# PatStore Kit (external monorepo)

PatStore plugin and CMS runtime live in **`../patstore-kit`** — not in this repo.

| Package | Path |
|---------|------|
| `@patstore/core` | `patstore-kit/packages/core` |
| `@patstore/vite-plugin` | `patstore-kit/packages/vite-plugin` |

Sites consume via `file:../patstore-kit/...` (local) or GitHub Packages (published).

After changing the kit: `cd patstore-kit && npx pnpm build`, then reinstall in the site if needed.

See `patstore-kit/docs/PUBLISHING.md` for GitHub Packages setup.
